    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b3de7c9534164e96ae079b5f3898dce6",
      "statement": "Since feature 039 the per-service `profiles:` assignments live inside each included component compose file rather than being re-declared in the stack aggregator, which removes the include-override merge (`services.<x> conflicts with imported resource`) that only newer Docker Compose accepted and lets the stack parse on any conformant Compose.",
