    {
      "id": "claim_c0f85c767f8540bfbb5ba64166e9e30a",
      "statement": "`scripts/check-komodo-sync.mjs` statically scans `infrastructure-as-code/komodo/**/*.toml` for a `*.ts.net` tailnet host, a Tailscale CGNAT address, or a hardcoded URL authority that is not a `[[var]]` token — including inside comments — so a real host/domain/IP/webhook cannot slip past the `[[var]]` discipline; `scripts/check-topology-scrub.mjs` is the complementary whole-tree guard against a real tailnet host re-entering git.",
      "evidence": [
