    {
      "id": "claim_c81a792bfe2549eca9fedd41986235e1",
      "statement": "`scripts/check-prod-restart-policy.mjs` requires every long-running service in `infrastructure-as-code/docker/**/compose.prod.yaml` to declare `restart: always`, forbids `restart: unless-stopped` (which does not return a container after a reboot on this host) and a missing `restart:` (which defaults to `no`), and exempts only genuine one-shot init/seed containers matching `*-init`, `*-seed`, `*-rs-init` or `createbucket`, where `always` would restart-loop.",
