    {
      "id": "claim_2775c18ac81b4c2a91f38acce7cc3e32",
      "statement": "All four core live production stacks were adopted in place rather than created by the ResourceSync: the `prod-app → prod-mcm-bff` rename and the manual creation of `prod-mc-service`/`prod-movie-assistant` were done by hand so the live stacks already carry the canonical names, which means a rename or restructuring in `stacks.toml` is a config diff against a running system and the diff should be previewed before applying.",
